# Re-architecture 2026-07 · W4 & v1.5.4 cross-platform line-ending hygiene.
# The byte-parity gate compares static/ file BYTES to the source raw string
# (which Python always reads with LF newlines), so web/source files must never
# be CRLF-translated on checkout. Keep source/web assets LF and Windows batch/PS1 CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.command text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
static/*.js text eol=lf
static/*.css text eol=lf
